{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751060/extras/loggo.png?t=1744207993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flora &amp; Fang: Guardians of the vampire garden is a single-player or local co-op adventure that puts you in the shoes of one of two lovable vampire siblings, Flora or Fang, as they embark on a mission to safeguard their dad\u2014the infamous Dracula's\u2014precious pumpkin garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751060/extras/Comp_2_1.gif?t=1744207993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight the insect invasion!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump, run, spray insects with bug spray, strategically place traps, and coordinate with your co-op partner to repel waves of bothersome bugs in a variety of single screen stages. The vampire gardens future depends on you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play alone or with a friend!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751060/extras/Comp_3.gif?t=1744207993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Place traps and upgrade your gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve into the world of traps and strategy, where earning coins allows you to purchase clever, upgradeable traps that transform the game into a more defensive experience with light tower defense strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751060/extras/Comp_4.gif?t=1744207993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Giant insect bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Confront larger-than-life insect bosses in thrilling boss battles that test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751060/extras/Comp_1.gif?t=1744207993\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2751060?t=1744207993","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751060/4dd3c5ce774ce5440cc91a5445ff7ad7c46f6baf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744207993","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751060/0f09be4c8cbc7c59084d00bd5d387c243edb4152/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744207993","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751060/0f09be4c8cbc7c59084d00bd5d387c243edb4152/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744207993","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3192730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751060/extras/loggo.png?t=1744207993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flora &amp; Fang: Guardians of the vampire garden is a single-player or local co-op adventure that puts you in the shoes of one of two lovable vampire siblings, Flora or Fang, as they embark on a mission to safeguard their dad\u2014the infamous Dracula's\u2014precious pumpkin